{
  "title": "Drum Rack 32",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Move's Drum Rack with",
        "32 pads, not 16.",
        "",
        "Loads Move's own kits",
        "and plays them with",
        "the same sampler",
        "voice, so a kit built",
        "on the device sounds",
        "like itself here.",
        "",
        "Any pad can also be",
        "a synth drum: Simian,",
        "Urchin, 9W9, 6W6,",
        "8W8 or CW-78.",
        "",
        "DR32 opens empty.",
        "Load a kit from the",
        "Category page."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pages",
      "lines": [
        "Jog moves between",
        "pages.",
        "",
        "Category",
        " pick a kit",
        "Pad",
        " what each pad",
        " plays, and where",
        " in the file",
        "Shape",
        " envelope and",
        " filter (samples)",
        "Tone, Noise, Voice..",
        " the synth voice",
        " (synth pads)",
        "Mix",
        " level, pan, sends",
        " and punch",
        "Master",
        " level for the kit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Loading kits",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Category",
          "lines": [
            "Click to go in, then",
            "click a row to open",
            "that group's kits.",
            "",
            "Acoustic, Electronic",
            "and Hybrid come from",
            "Move's own library.",
            "My Kits is what you",
            "have made.",
            "",
            "Only real drum kits",
            "are listed. Your",
            "preset folder holds",
            "presets for every",
            "instrument, and most",
            "cannot load as a",
            "rack."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Scrolling loads",
          "lines": [
            "Moving the cursor",
            "loads the kit under",
            "it, a moment after",
            "you stop. So you can",
            "hear your way",
            "through a group.",
            "",
            "There is NO undo.",
            "The kit you were on",
            "is replaced. Save",
            "first."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pads",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Choosing a pad",
          "lines": [
            "32 pads, notes",
            "36 to 67.",
            "",
            "Hit a pad and the",
            "editor follows it,",
            "while the transport",
            "is stopped.",
            "",
            "The PAD knob picks",
            "a pad by hand,",
            "1 to 32.",
            "",
            "Sample, Shape and",
            "Mix all edit the",
            "SAME pad. Changing",
            "it on one page",
            "changes it on all",
            "three."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pad",
          "lines": [
            "PAD   which pad",
            "ENGN  pick what the",
            " pad plays: a",
            " sample, or a synth",
            " drum",
            "STRT  start point",
            "END   end point",
            "TRSP  semitones",
            "DETN  cents",
            "CHOKE choke group.",
            " Pads sharing one",
            " cut each other off",
            "VOL   the pad's level",
            "",
            "STRT and END are",
            "for samples only."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Synth pads",
          "lines": [
            "ENGN opens a picker:",
            "",
            "Sample",
            " Move and User",
            " libraries",
            "Simian",
            " a classic synth",
            " drum voice",
            "Urchin",
            " modelled drums,",
            " hats and cymbals",
            " Media: its record",
            " noise, saturation,",
            " rate and bits",
            "9W9, 6W6, 8W8, CW-78",
            " one drum of each",
            " machine, as the",
            " machine plays it",
            "",
            "Scroll to put a drum",
            "on the pad, click to",
            "take it and close.",
            "",
            "A synth pad gets its",
            "engine's pages in",
            "place of Shape. Mix,",
            "sends, choke, Link",
            "and Copy work the",
            "same as on a sample.",
            "",
            "Vel Vol starts at 0:",
            "the engine already",
            "answers velocity.",
            "",
            "A machine drum's",
            "Voice page: Tune,",
            "Decay, its own knob,",
            "Drive, Distortion,",
            "Velocity. 0-127,",
            "like the machine.",
            "Transpose moves Tune",
            "(not on the 9W9",
            "kick: its Tune is",
            "the sweep time)."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Shape",
          "lines": [
            "ATK   attack",
            "DCY   decay",
            "HOLD  hold",
            "ENV   A-H-D or",
            "      A-S-R",
            "CUT   filter freq",
            "RES   resonance",
            "TYPE  filter type,",
            " four of them",
            "FILT  filter on/off"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Mix",
          "lines": [
            "VVOL  how much",
            " velocity moves",
            " the level",
            "VOL   pad level",
            "PAN   pad position",
            "LINK  see Link",
            "SNDA  send A amount",
            "SNDB  send B amount",
            "PUNCH transient",
            " shaper. Above",
            " zero it turns",
            " itself on",
            "PTIME punch time"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Copying pads",
          "lines": [
            "Hold COPY and hit a",
            "pad. That pad is",
            "the source.",
            "",
            "Every pad you hit",
            "while you keep",
            "holding is pasted",
            "into, sample and",
            "all.",
            "",
            "Hold DELETE and hit",
            "pads to clear them.",
            "",
            "UNDO puts back the",
            "last pad you wrote",
            "over.",
            "",
            "The WHOLE pad",
            "travels, not just",
            "the page you are",
            "on: sample, tuning,",
            "envelope, filter,",
            "level, pan, sends,",
            "punch.",
            "",
            "Its note and browse",
            "spot do not. Those",
            "are what make it",
            "that pad."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Link",
      "lines": [
        "LINK sets one",
        "control across every",
        "pad.",
        "",
        "Click it on, turn a",
        "knob, and every pad",
        "takes that value.",
        "",
        "It releases as soon",
        "as you change",
        "ANYTHING else - any",
        "other knob, a",
        "sample, a browse",
        "step, the master.",
        "So the next thing",
        "you touch is that",
        "pad's alone.",
        "",
        "Playing a pad does",
        "not end it. You can",
        "audition while you",
        "sweep.",
        "",
        "It never spreads",
        "what makes a pad its",
        "own: the sample, the",
        "note, or the browse",
        "spot.",
        "",
        "It is off whenever",
        "DR32 loads."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Buses & sends",
      "lines": [
        "Two ways out, and",
        "they are different.",
        "",
        "BUSES group. Schwung",
        "can put any set of",
        "pads on their own",
        "bus, with its own",
        "insert effects. Hats",
        "through a reverb,",
        "kick dry.",
        "",
        "You build them in",
        "Schwung, not here.",
        "Pads show up under",
        "their sample names,",
        "and a routing",
        "survives a kit",
        "change.",
        "",
        "SENDS tap. SNDA and",
        "SNDB set how much of",
        "a pad goes to the",
        "two global returns,",
        "in dB. One reverb",
        "for the kit, not one",
        "per pad.",
        "",
        "A Move kit brings",
        "its own send",
        "amounts.",
        "",
        "DR32 has no effects",
        "of its own. All of",
        "this is the host's."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Saving",
      "lines": [
        "Your edits are",
        "stored in the",
        "Schwung set, on top",
        "of the kit that was",
        "loaded.",
        "",
        "So a set records",
        "which kit you used",
        "and what you",
        "changed.",
        "",
        "Kits are Move's own",
        "files and are never",
        "modified."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Limits",
      "lines": [
        "Pads 17 to 32 are",
        "outside Move's 4x4",
        "pad map, so the",
        "small map in the",
        "header does not",
        "light for them.",
        "",
        "Pad effects besides",
        "Punch are kept when",
        "a kit is saved, so",
        "kits reopen on Move,",
        "but are not played",
        "back.",
        "",
        "Effects saved in a",
        "kit's return chain",
        "are kept, but not",
        "set up for you.",
        "",
        "Browsing kits has no",
        "undo.",
        "",
        "A Move kit is only",
        "samples, so loading",
        "one turns every pad",
        "back to a sample.",
        "Synth pads are kept",
        "in the Schwung set."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
